<ul>
<li>A. 选项中 SRAM 和 DRAM 位置反了</li>
<li>C. 选项中，硬盘容量 1GB=<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10^9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8141em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">0</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8141em;"><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> Byte，因此容量应该为 8.192GB（回忆：内存及以上存储器使用 2 的幂次，硬盘使用 10 的幂次）</li>
<li>D. 选项中，平均旋转延迟为 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>60</mn><mtext>s</mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">/</mi><mn>6000</mn><mtext>RPM</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.5\\times(60\\text{s}/6000\\text{RPM})=5\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord">0.5</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">×</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord">60</span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">s</span></span><span class="mord">/6000</span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">RPM</span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">5</span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">ms</span></span></span></span></span>，平均访问时间为 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><mtext>ms</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext>ms</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">9\\text{ms} + 5\\text{ms} = 14\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord">9</span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">ms</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">5</span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">ms</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">14</span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">ms</span></span></span></span></span></li>
<li>E. SDRAM 和 SRAM 无关，其 S 是 Synchronous 的缩写，表示同步的意思</li>
</ul>
